  "Description": {
    "Cost": 1021234,
    "UIName": "Lobo",
    "Id": "chassisdef_lobo_LOB-1",
    "Name": "Lobo",
    "Details": "At long range, the Lobo makes use of its ER large laser. As it closes, it can makes use of paired ATM-6s, paired heavy medium lasers and a heavy small laser. The meager 10 double heat sinks allotted to the design cannot hope to keep it cool, so MechWarriors have resorted to running the heat up to the red, then disengaging to cool off.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Accurate Weapon - Laser</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.08</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Lower, Right Lower</color>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_lobo"
  },
